  "premise": "Directional event information is conditional on the published market state; a state-matched base and a state gate produce lift where the unconditional vote does not.",
  "economic_rationale": "Trend, coiling, expanding, high-range/low-participation, and settling states are governed by different market mechanisms. An unconditional vote averages them into zero. The state is a published causal reading, not a fitted classifier.",
